### ── Health ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health
Accept: application/json

### ── Stats (frontend dashboard) ─────────────────────────────────────
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/stats
Accept: application/json

### ── 1. Ingest: BGE-M3 only ─────────────────────────────────────────
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/documents/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chunks": [
    {
      "text": "FastAPI is a modern web framework for building APIs with Python. It is fast and easy to use, with automatic OpenAPI documentation.",
      "metadata": {"source": "docs", "topic": "fastapi"}
    },
    {
      "text": "RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) is a technique that combines document retrieval with LLM text generation for accurate answers.",
      "metadata": {"source": "blog", "topic": "rag"}
    },
    {
      "text": "Milvus Lite is an embedded vector database that runs locally with zero configuration, perfect for prototyping and small-scale deployments.",
      "metadata": {"source": "docs", "topic": "vector-db"}
    },
    {
      "text": "BGE-M3 is a multilingual embedding model supporting dense retrieval, sparse retrieval, and multi-vector retrieval.",
      "metadata": {"source": "research", "topic": "embedding"}
    },
    {
      "text": "BM25 is a traditional term-frequency based ranking function used for lexical search in information retrieval systems.",
      "metadata": {"source": "docs", "topic": "search"}
    },
    {
      "text": "BGE-Reranker is a cross-encoder model that re-ranks candidate documents for improved retrieval accuracy.",
      "metadata": {"source": "research", "topic": "reranker"}
    }
  ],
  "collection": "default"
}

### ── 2. Ingest raw text (auto-chunked) ──────────────────────────────
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/documents/ingest-text
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

text=BGE-M3是一种多语言嵌入模型，支持稠密检索、稀疏检索和多向量检索。它在多种语言上表现出色，包括中文和英文。&collection=default&metadata={"source":"manual","language":"zh"}

### ── 3. Rebuild BM25 index (separate step!) ─────────────────────────
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/index/bm25/rebuild?collection=default
Accept: application/json

### ── 4. Full hybrid search ──────────────────────────────────────────
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "what is the best way to retrieve documents?",
  "collection": "default",
  "top_k": 5,
  "hybrid": true,
  "rerank": true
}

### Search: dense only (no BM25, no reranker)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "embedding model for Chinese",
  "collection": "default",
  "top_k": 5,
  "hybrid": false,
  "rerank": false
}

### Search: with metadata filter
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "vector database",
  "collection": "default",
  "top_k": 5,
  "filters": {"topic": "vector-db"}
}

### ── 5. Documents CRUD ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### List documents (paginated)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/documents?collection=default&offset=0&limit=10
Accept: application/json

### Get single document (replace doc_id with actual ID from list)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/documents/some-doc-id?collection=default
Accept: application/json

### Delete single document
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/documents/some-doc-id?collection=default
Accept: application/json

### ── 6. Collections ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/collections
Accept: application/json

### Get collection detail
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/collections/default
Accept: application/json

### Delete entire collection (caution!)
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/collections/test
Accept: application/json

### ── 7. Upload file (TXT example) ───────────────────────────────────
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/documents/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="hello.txt"

Hello RAG! This is a test document uploaded via the API.
It will be automatically parsed, chunked, and indexed with BGE-M3.

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="collection"

default
------boundary--
